\f0\fs24 \cf2 Look at the detail on the door of Fausto\'92s bedroom: a scroll-like motif inspired by a pilaster from the Church of Santa Maria dei Miracoli in Venice. But the Bagatti Valsecchi brothers didn\'92t just copy it, they reinterpreted it, adapting it perfectly to their home. Their love for Venetian art is evident in every corner of the house, and this detail takes us back to the work of great masters like Pietro Lombardo and his sons. A connection between Venice and Milan slowly reveals itself, in the most hidden details.}